                                "sense_id": "4ae57ad6-acfa-35c4-9d69-247d3f31ed15",
                                "text": "1993, Vikram Seth, A Suitable Boy, London: Phoenix, 1994, Part 8, p. 554,\nMaan loved swimming, not for the exercise but for the luxury, the tactility of it."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
